{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    with middle of the this section i need "view all products" button, i need  small cart icon button and view all pro
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; max-width:100%; box-sizing:border-box; background:{{ block.settings.background }}; border-radius:{{ block.settings.radius }}px; padding:clamp(24px,4vw,56px); position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}:before { content:""; position:absolute; width:440px; height:440px; right:-140px; top:-170px; border-radius:50%; pointer-events:none; background:repeating-conic-gradient(from 5deg, rgba(31,81,48,.055) 0deg 8deg, transparent 8deg 16deg); -webkit-mask:radial-gradient(circle, #000 0 38%, transparent 70%); mask:radial-gradient(circle, #000 0 38%, transparent 70%); }
  .ai-nursery-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} { position:relative; z-index:1; width:100%; margin:0 auto; }
  .ai-nursery-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; align-items:end; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; margin-bottom:24px; }
  .ai-nursery-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} h2 { color:#1f5130; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,40px); line-height:1.15; margin:0; }
  .ai-nursery-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} p { color:#5b6660; margin:8px 0 0; }
  .ai-nursery-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; gap:9px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .ai-nursery-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} { border:1px solid #1f5130; border-radius:50%; width:44px; height:44px; display:grid; place-items:center; background:transparent; color:#1f5130; cursor:pointer; }
  .ai-nursery-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}--next { background:#1f5130; color:#fff; }
  .ai-nursery-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled { opacity:.35; cursor:not-allowed; }
  .ai-nursery-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; gap:18px; overflow-x:auto; scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; scroll-behavior:smooth; scrollbar-width:none; padding:4px 2px 14px; }
  .ai-nursery-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; }
  .ai-nursery-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} { flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3); min-width:0; scroll-snap-align:start; background:#fff; border-radius:{{ block.settings.radius }}px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(23,49,32,.07); transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover { transform:translateY(-4px); box-shadow:0 12px 26px rgba(23,49,32,.14); }
  .ai-nursery-photo-{{ ai_gen_id }} { height:clamp(190px,22vw,290px); background:#f4f1e8; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .ai-nursery-photo-{{ ai_gen_id }} img { width:100%; height:100%; display:block; object-fit:cover; transition:transform .35s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nursery-photo-{{ ai_gen_id }} img { transform:scale(1.025); }
  .ai-nursery-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width:100%; height:100%; display:grid; place-items:center; color:#5b6660; }
  .ai-nursery-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg { width:100%; height:100%; max-height:240px; }
  .ai-nursery-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} { position:absolute; top:12px; left:12px; background:#1f5130; color:#fff; border-radius:20px; padding:6px 10px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }
  .ai-nursery-off-{{ ai_gen_id }} { position:absolute; top:12px; right:12px; background:#ffd60a; color:#14231a; border-radius:20px; padding:6px 10px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }
  .ai-nursery-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding:16px; position:relative; min-height:156px; }
  .ai-nursery-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size:12px; color:#14231a; margin-bottom:7px; }
  .ai-nursery-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }} strong { color:#1f5130; }
  .ai-nursery-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} h3 { color:#1f5130; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:19px; line-height:1.2; margin:0 38px 6px 0; }
  .ai-nursery-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }} { color:#5b6660; font-size:13px; line-height:1.45; margin:0 0 12px; }
  .ai-nursery-prices-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:baseline; flex-wrap:wrap; color:#14231a; }
  .ai-nursery-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-weight:700; }
  .ai-nursery-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} { color:#68736c; font-size:13px; text-decoration:line-through; }
  .ai-nursery-add-{{ ai_gen_id }} { position:absolute; right:14px; bottom:14px; height:40px; width:40px; padding:0; border:0; border-radius:50%; display:grid; place-items:center; background:#1f5130; color:white; cursor:pointer; }
  .ai-nursery-add-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover { transform:scale(1.06); }
  .ai-nursery-add-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus-visible,.ai-nursery-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus-visible,.ai-nursery-view-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #9a7600; outline-offset:3px; }
  .ai-nursery-viewrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; justify-content:center; margin-top:18px; }
  .ai-nursery-view-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:46px; padding:0 24px; border-radius:30px; background:#1f5130; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700; }
  .ai-nursery-view-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover { background:#0d3a1d; }
  @media(max-width:990px) { .ai-nursery-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} { flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2); } .ai-nursery-photo-{{ ai_gen_id }} { height:260px; } }
  @media(max-width:600px) { .ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding:24px 16px; } .ai-nursery-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} { align-items:center; } .ai-nursery-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} h2 { font-size:26px; } .ai-nursery-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} p { font-size:13px; } .ai-nursery-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }} { gap:6px; } .ai-nursery-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width:38px;height:38px; } .ai-nursery-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} { gap:12px; } .ai-nursery-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} { flex-basis:84%; } .ai-nursery-photo-{{ ai_gen_id }} { height:250px; } }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .ai-nursery-track-{{ ai_gen_id }},.ai-nursery-card-{{ ai_gen_id }},.ai-nursery-photo-{{ ai_gen_id }} img { scroll-behavior:auto; transition:none; } }
{% endstyle %}

<plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-nursery-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-nursery-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><div><h2>{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}<p>{{ block.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>{% endif %}</div>
      <div class="ai-nursery-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><button class="ai-nursery-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-nursery-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}" type="button" aria-label="Scroll products left"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><button class="ai-nursery-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-nursery-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}--next ai-nursery-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}" type="button" aria-label="Scroll products right"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-nursery-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" tabindex="0" aria-label="Plant products">
      {% for i in (1..6) %}
        {% liquid
          assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i
          assign product_key = 'product_' | append: i
          assign title_key = 'title_' | append: i
          assign description_key = 'description_' | append: i
          assign price_key = 'price_' | append: i
          assign compare_key = 'compare_' | append: i
          assign discount_key = 'discount_' | append: i
          assign bestseller_key = 'bestseller_' | append: i
          assign bestseller_text_key = 'bestseller_text_' | append: i
          assign rating_key = 'rating_' | append: i
          assign reviews_key = 'reviews_' | append: i
          assign card_bg_key = 'card_bg_' | append: i
          assign card_image = block.settings[image_key]
          assign card_product = block.settings[product_key]
          assign card_title = block.settings[title_key]
          assign card_description = block.settings[description_key]
          assign card_price = block.settings[price_key]
          assign card_compare = block.settings[compare_key]
          assign card_discount = block.settings[discount_key]
          assign card_bestseller = block.settings[bestseller_key]
          assign card_bestseller_text = block.settings[bestseller_text_key]
          assign card_rating = block.settings[rating_key]
          assign card_reviews = block.settings[reviews_key]
          assign card_bg = block.settings[card_bg_key]
          assign card_variant = card_product.selected_or_first_available_variant
        %}
        {% if card_product != blank or card_image != blank or card_title != blank %}
          <article class="ai-nursery-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="background:{{ card_bg }}">
            <div class="ai-nursery-photo-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if card_image != blank %}<img src="{{ card_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ card_image.alt | default: card_title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ card_image.width }}" height="{{ card_image.height }}">{% elsif card_product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ card_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ card_product.featured_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ card_product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ card_product.featured_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-nursery-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}
              {% if card_bestseller %}<span class="ai-nursery-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_bestseller_text | escape }}</span>{% endif %}{% if card_discount != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-off-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_discount | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-nursery-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><div class="ai-nursery-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><strong>★ {{ card_rating | escape }}</strong> <span>| {{ card_reviews | escape }}</span></div><h3>{% if card_product != blank %}{{ card_title | default: card_product.title | escape }}{% else %}{{ card_title | escape }}{% endif %}</h3><p class="ai-nursery-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_description | escape }}</p><div class="ai-nursery-prices-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% if card_product != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_product.price | money }}</span>{% if card_product.compare_at_price > card_product.price %}<span class="ai-nursery-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}{% else %}{% if card_price != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_price | escape }}</span>{% endif %}{% if card_compare != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_compare | escape }}</span>{% endif %}{% endif %}</div>
              {% if card_product != blank and card_variant != blank %}<form action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ card_variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><button class="ai-nursery-add-{{ ai_gen_id }}" type="submit" aria-label="Add {{ card_title | default: card_product.title | escape }} to cart" {% unless card_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h2l2.2 11.2a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h8.9a2 2 0 0 0 1.9-1.4L22 8H6"/><circle cx="10" cy="20" r="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1"/></svg></button></form>{% elsif block.settings.fallback_link != blank %}<a class="ai-nursery-add-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ block.settings.fallback_link }}" aria-label="View product"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 3h2l2.2 11.2a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h8.9a2 2 0 0 0 1.9-1.4L22 8H6"/><circle cx="10" cy="20" r="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="ai-nursery-viewrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><a class="ai-nursery-view-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ block.settings.view_all_label | escape }}</a></div>
  </div>
</plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>
(function(){
  const tag='plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
  if(customElements.get(tag)) return;
  class PlantCarousel extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback(){
      this.track=this.querySelector('.ai-nursery-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      this.prev=this.querySelector('.ai-nursery-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      this.next=this.querySelector('.ai-nursery-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      if(!this.track) return;
      this.prev.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(-1));
      this.next.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(1));
      this.track.addEventListener('scroll',()=>this.update(),{passive:true});
      this.update();
    }
    move(direction){const card=this.track.querySelector('.ai-nursery-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}');if(card){const gap=parseFloat(getComputedStyle(this.track).gap)||0;this.track.scrollBy({left:direction*(card.getBoundingClientRect().width+gap),behavior:'smooth'});}}
    update(){const end=this.track.scrollWidth-this.track.clientWidth;this.prev.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft<=2;this.next.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft>=end-2;}
  }
  customElements.define(tag,PlantCarousel);
})();
</script>
